# Rust
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock

# Node (Tauri CLI, desktop app)
node_modules/
desktop/src-tauri/gen/

# Note: desktop/src-tauri/icons/*.png|.ico|.icns ARE committed, unlike a
# typical Tauri scaffold. tauri-build's build script requires them to exist
# for any `cargo build`/`cargo test` on Windows (embeds a Windows resource),
# not only for `npm run build`, so a placeholder set is checked in rather
# than left as a manual pre-build step every contributor has to remember.
# Replace with real branding whenever that exists; regenerate via
# `npx tauri icon path/to/logo.png` from inside desktop/.

# Local databases created by running scg-scan or the desktop app
*.db
*.sqlite

# Editor/OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Ignore the .env file if it exists, but keep the example file
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Ignore .patch and .bundle files created by the desktop app
*.patch
*.bundle